# CertiHeal-Edge: A Local-Field Framework with Repairability Certificates for Self-Healing IoT/Edge Fabrics

Long Dinh Tuan¹

¹ Faculty of Information Technology, Hanoi Open University, Hanoi, Vietnam · dinhtuanlong@hou.edu.vn · ORCID 0009-0005-0752-8531

